          "position": [
            64,
            127
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A subtotal is arithmetic, not an observation: a row flagged by "
        },
        {
          "position": [
            127,
            134
          ],
          "type": "inlineCode",
          "value": "total"
        },
        {
          "position": [
            134,
            642
          ],
          "type": "text",
          "value": " is drawn\nfrom the baseline to the running total as the steps above it left it, and its\nown value cell is not read. So only the closing balance is flagged. The opening\nbalance is the walk's first step — a rise from zero — because a bridge that\nbegan at a subtotal would begin at nothing. Connectors carry the running balance\nbetween bars so the walk is legible as one continuous quantity, and direction\nuses the status palette because increase and decrease are a fixed vocabulary of\ntwo, never palette slots."
        }
